---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="仕事・天職・転機 | 陰陽寮">
  <div class="page">
    <div class="stars" id="stars"></div>

    <div class="page-inner">

      <header class="page-header fade-in-up">
        <div class="header-icon">💼</div>
        <h1 class="page-title">仕事・天職・転機</h1>
        <p class="page-desc">あなたの隠された才能と、人生を飛躍させる「絶好のタイミング」を導き出します。</p>
        <div class="header-divider"></div>
      </header>

      <!-- 統計バナー -->
      <div class="stats-banner fade-in-up delay-1">
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">4,800+</span><span class="stat-label">転職成功者</span></div>
        <div class="stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">97%</span><span class="stat-label">的中率</span></div>
        <div class="stat-divider"></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><span class="stat-num">3,000年</span><span class="stat-label">の叡智</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="premium-menus">

        <!-- カード1 -->
        <div class="glass-card menu-card theme-work fade-in-up delay-1">
          <div class="menu-badge hot">人気No.1</div>
          <div class="menu-header">
            <h2 class="menu-title">【四柱推命】あなたが生まれ持つ「本当の天職」と、人生最大の成功期</h2>
            <div class="menu-price">300<span>C</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-desc">今の仕事にやりがいを感じられないなら、それは宿命に合っていないからかもしれません。あなたが最も輝ける職業と、社会的に大きな成功を収める時期を命式から完全に紐解きます。</p>

          <div class="teaser-box">
            <p class="teaser-label">✦ この鑑定でわかること</p>
            <ul>
              <li>あなたに秘められた「3つの特別な才能」</li>
              <li>適性の高い業界・職種（独立向きか、組織向きか）</li>
              <li>才能が開花し、評価が爆発する「成功の年齢」</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="review-row">
            <span class="stars-rating">★★★★★</span>
            <span class="review-text">「鑑定通りの職種に転職して年収が1.5倍になりました」— 35歳・男性</span>
          </div>

          <div class="btn-group">
            <button class="btn-primary" onclick="window.location.href='/fortune/shichu'">✦ 無料でお試し鑑定する</button>
            <span class="btn-note">※生年月日のみで鑑定開始</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- カード2 -->
        <div class="glass-card menu-card theme-work fade-in-up delay-2">
          <div class="menu-badge special">決断特化</div>
          <div class="menu-header">
            <h2 class="menu-title">【九星気学】「今の仕事を辞めるべき？」ベストな転職タイミングと大吉方位</h2>
            <div class="menu-price">500<span>C</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-desc">転職は動く「時期」と「方位」でその後のキャリアが劇的に変わります。現状に留まるべきか、動くべきか。そして、履歴書を出すべき最高の日取りをお伝えします。</p>

          <div class="teaser-box">
            <p class="teaser-label">✦ この鑑定でわかること</p>
            <ul>
              <li>今動くべきか、待つべきか（年運・月運で判定）</li>
              <li>転職に最適な方位と、避けるべき企業の場所</li>
              <li>入社日・初出社日として最強の吉日</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="review-row">
            <span class="stars-rating">★★★★★</span>
            <span class="review-text">「吉日に動いたら内定が3社から出ました」— 29歳・女性</span>
          </div>

          <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="window.location.href='/fortune/kyuseiki'">✦ この鑑定を始める（500C）</button>
        </div>

        <!-- カード3 -->
        <div class="glass-card menu-card theme-work fade-in-up delay-3">
          <div class="menu-badge new">NEW</div>
          <div class="menu-header">
            <h2 class="menu-title">【宿曜占星術】上司・取引先との相性と、職場の人間関係を劇的に改善する秘訣</h2>
            <div class="menu-price">200<span>C</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-desc">ビジネスの成否は「人間関係」で9割決まります。あなたと上司・同僚・取引先の宿曜の相性を読み解き、相手の心を動かすコミュニケーション戦略をお伝えします。</p>

          <div class="teaser-box">
            <p class="teaser-label">✦ この鑑定でわかること</p>
            <ul>
              <li>上司・同僚との相性（安・壊・栄・親・胎・殺）</li>
              <li>相手が「YES」と言いやすいアプローチ方法</li>
              <li>職場での味方の作り方と、避けるべき人物</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="window.location.href='/fortune/sukuyo'">✦ この鑑定を始める（200C）</button>
        </div>

        <!-- 即答カード -->
        <div class="glass-card menu-card theme-work instant-card fade-in-up delay-4">
          <div class="menu-badge instant">今すぐ回答</div>
          <div class="menu-header">
            <h2 class="menu-title">【易占い】明日の商談・面接は成功する？今すぐ答えを出す</h2>
            <div class="menu-price">1<span>C</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="menu-desc">直近の仕事の悩みに、六十四卦が白黒つけます。A案とB案の選択、商談の成否、転職の吉凶—今この瞬間の問いに今すぐ答えます。</p>
          <button class="btn-primary btn-instant" onclick="window.location.href='/fortune/eki'">⚡ 今すぐ占う（1C）</button>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- 安心保証 -->
      <div class="trust-section fade-in-up">
        <div class="trust-item"><span>🔒</span><span>SSL暗号化通信</span></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span>✨</span><span>3,000年の叡智</span></div>
        <div class="trust-item"><span>💎</span><span>満足度98%</span></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
.page { padding: 3rem 1.5rem; min-height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.stars { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }
.page-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

.page-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.header-icon { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(59,130,246,0.6)); }
.page-title { font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size: 2rem; color: #bfdbfe; text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(59,130,246,0.5); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.page-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; }
.header-divider { width: 60px; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#3b82f6,transparent); margin: 1rem auto 0; }

.stats-banner {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 2rem;
  background: rgba(59,130,246,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
  border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
}
.stat-item { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1rem; gap: 0.25rem; }
.stat-num { font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; color: #93c5fd; font-weight: bold; }
.stat-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
.stat-divider { width: 1px; height: 40px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.2); }

.premium-menus { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }
.menu-card {
  position: relative; padding: 3rem 2.5rem 2.5rem;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(16,20,36,0.9), rgba(8,10,20,0.95));
  transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}
.menu-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(59,130,246,0.12); }
.theme-work { border-top: 3px solid #3b82f6; }
.instant-card { border-top: 3px solid #06b6d4; }

.menu-badge {
  position: absolute; top: 0; left: 2rem; transform: translateY(-50%);
  padding: 4px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: bold; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}
.menu-badge.hot { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(244,63,94,0.5); }
.menu-badge.special { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #06b6d4); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(59,130,246,0.5); }
.menu-badge.new { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #06b6d4); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(16,185,129,0.5); }
.menu-badge.instant { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #06b6d4, #3b82f6); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(6,182,212,0.5); animation: badge-glow 1.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes badge-glow { 0%,100%{box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(6,182,212,0.5)} 50%{box-shadow:0 4px 25px rgba(6,182,212,0.9)} }

.menu-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
.menu-title { font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size: 1.35rem; color: #fff; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; flex: 1; }
.menu-price { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: bold; color: var(--gold-light); white-space: nowrap; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.1); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.3); }
.menu-price span { font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 2px; color: var(--gold); }
.menu-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }

.teaser-box { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.05); border: 1px dashed rgba(59,130,246,0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
.teaser-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #93c5fd; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
.teaser-box ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
.teaser-box li { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; line-height: 1.7; }
.teaser-box li::before { content: '✓'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #93c5fd; }

.review-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border-radius: 8px; }
.stars-rating { color: #fbbf24; font-size: 14px; }
.review-text { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-style: italic; }

.btn-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
.btn-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
.btn-secondary {
  width: 100%; padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  background: rgba(59,130,246,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.35);
  color: #93c5fd; font-family: 'Noto Serif JP', serif; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
}
.btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.22); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.6); }
.btn-instant { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #0891b2) !important; border: none !important; }

.trust-section { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border-radius: 12px; border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
.trust-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.375rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
.trust-item span:first-child { font-size: 20px; }

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .menu-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .menu-price { align-self: flex-start; }
  .menu-title { font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .menu-card { padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 1.5rem; }
  .stats-banner { gap: 0; }
  .stat-num { font-size: 1.1rem; }
}
</style>

<script is:inline>
const starsEl = document.getElementById('stars');
if (starsEl && starsEl.children.length === 0) {
  for (let i = 0; i < 60; i++) {
    const s = document.createElement('div');
    const size = Math.random() * 2 + 0.5;
    s.style.cssText = `position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;width:${size}px;height:${size}px;top:${Math.random()*100}%;left:${Math.random()*100}%;opacity:${Math.random()*0.4+0.1};animation:twinkle ${2+Math.random()*4}s ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:${Math.random()*4}s;`;
    starsEl.appendChild(s);
  }
}
</script>